{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/835076-unofficial-demon-the-descent-trailer","id":835076,"title":"Unofficial Demon: The Descent Trailer","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-22T08:37:53-08:00","id":835076,"title":"Unofficial Demon: The Descent Trailer","content":"Hello fellow gamers,<br /> <br /> Last night I started a new Chronicle of Demon: The Descent for my local group. To get their gears turning and oil pumping I created a trailer for my chronicle. I figured it makes a pretty decent unofficial trailer for Demon itself since I left it more vague to the general state of Demons, and used the first paragraph of the Demon core book. <br /> <br /> I made sure to give credit to Onxy Path Publishing and linked the book in the video description (as well as any other sources I used). <br /> I would make my day if someone from Onxy Path saw this video. I'm obviously a huge fan of their work.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/mCuT-Mi_4tw\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/mCuT-Mi_4tw\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/mCuT-Mi_4tw\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/mCuT-Mi_4tw </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1310-samare","name":"Samare","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1310_2.png","